---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale / OpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_supplied: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_check_not_canceled: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_check_capital_returned: isCanceled == false
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert: revert AlreadyCanceled
    q_check_capital_returned --> q_set_canceled: if capitalWithdrawn, capital must be returned including fees
    q_check_capital_returned --> q_revert: revert CapitalNotReturned
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_check_capital_returned
        INV-001: if capital was withdrawn, project must return full amount including fees
        INV-002: cancellation before token supply enables investor refunds
        INV-003: cancellation is irreversible
    end note
